{
  "_comment": [
    "MACHINE HUB - what a technician sees after scanning the QR sticker.",
    "",
    "THE FORM LINKS ARE BUILT HERE, NOT STORED ON THE LIST.",
    "",
    "Machine_Master used to carry four hyperlink columns per machine - checklist,",
    "breakdown, spare, abnormality - which meant 120 URLs (30 machines x 4) typed",
    "into a spreadsheet and pasted in, every one of them a chance to point a button",
    "at the wrong machine. They are now assembled from the machine's own ID at",
    "render time, so there is nothing per-machine to maintain and a button cannot",
    "disagree with the row it sits on.",
    "",
    "WHAT YOU MUST EDIT BEFORE THIS WORKS  -  11 placeholders, once.",
    "",
    "For each form, open it and take a prefilled link:",
    "     Forms > Collect responses > Get a link to prefill answers",
    "Fill in Machine ID = MC-01-001 and Cell ID = CELL-01 (and on the checklist,",
    "pick a Checklist ID too), leave everything else blank, and Get link. You get:",
    "",
    "     https://forms.office.com/r/AbCdEf?id=XXXX&r1a2b3c4=MC-01-001&r5d6e7f8=CELL-01",
    "      \\________________ up to and including the = ________________/           ",
    "                                                        \\___________/          ",
    "",
    "Cut it into two pieces and paste them over the placeholders below:",
    "  FORM_<NAME>_UPTO_MACHINE   everything before the machine ID   ...&r1a2b3c4=",
    "  FORM_<NAME>_UPTO_CELL      the next key, with its & and =     &r5d6e7f8=",
    "The checklist has a third, FORM_CHECKLIST_UPTO_CLID, for its question 3.",
    "",
    "Do NOT retype these by hand. Copy and paste both halves out of one real link.",
    "Those r-codes are that form's question IDs. They are stable for the life of the",
    "form, which is why Machine ID and Cell ID must stay as questions 1 and 2 (and",
    "Checklist ID as question 3 on the checklist) and must never be reordered.",
    "",
    "Design constraints that are not negotiable:",
    "  * Every button is 48 px tall. These are pressed with gloved fingers, one",
    "    handed, next to a running machine. 44 px is the accessibility floor;",
    "    48 gives margin for a glove.",
    "  * Machine name is shown large so the technician confirms he scanned the",
    "    sticker he thinks he scanned. A wrong sticker found later is a field problem",
    "    that takes a month to trace.",
    "  * REPORT BREAKDOWN is the only red button on the card. It sits fourth because",
    "    the three above it are the daily path, but it is found by colour, not by",
    "    position - which is how it stays findable by someone who is in a hurry."
  ],

  "ViewFormat": {
    "$schema": "https://developer.microsoft.com/json-schemas/sp/v2/row-formatting.schema.json",
    "hideSelection": true,
    "hideColumnHeader": true,
    "elmType": "div",
    "style": {
      "font-family": "'Segoe UI', system-ui, sans-serif",
      "background-color": "#FFFFFF",
      "border": "1px solid #D9E2E6",
      "border-radius": "10px",
      "padding": "20px",
      "margin-bottom": "12px",
      "box-shadow": "0 1px 3px rgba(12,53,73,0.10)"
    },
    "children": [
      {
        "elmType": "div",
        "style": { "display": "flex", "flex-direction": "row", "align-items": "center", "margin-bottom": "4px" },
        "children": [
          {
            "elmType": "div",
            "txt": "=[$Machine_ID]",
            "style": { "font-size": "26px", "font-weight": "700", "color": "#0C3549", "letter-spacing": "0.5px" }
          },
          {
            "elmType": "div",
            "txt": "='  ·  Criticality ' + [$Criticality]",
            "style": {
              "font-size": "13px", "font-weight": "600", "margin-left": "10px",
              "padding": "3px 10px", "border-radius": "12px", "color": "#FFFFFF",
              "background-color": "=if([$Criticality] == 'A', '#ED7373', if([$Criticality] == 'B', '#F0A202', '#7B8794'))"
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "elmType": "div",
        "txt": "=[$Machine_Name]",
        "style": { "font-size": "18px", "font-weight": "600", "color": "#1F2933", "margin-bottom": "2px" }
      },
      {
        "elmType": "div",
        "txt": "=[$Cell_ID] + '  |  ' + [$Location_Tag] + '  |  Checklist ' + [$Checklist_ID]",
        "style": { "font-size": "13px", "color": "#7B8794", "margin-bottom": "16px" }
      },

      {
        "elmType": "div",
        "style": { "display": "flex", "flex-direction": "column" },
        "children": [
          {
            "elmType": "a",
            "txt": "▶   START PM  (scan in)",
            "attributes": {
              "href": "='FORM_START_UPTO_MACHINE' + [$Machine_ID] + 'FORM_START_UPTO_CELL' + [$Cell_ID]",
              "target": "_blank", "role": "button"
            },
            "style": {
              "display": "flex", "align-items": "center", "justify-content": "center",
              "height": "48px", "min-height": "48px", "margin-bottom": "10px",
              "border-radius": "8px", "text-decoration": "none",
              "font-size": "16px", "font-weight": "700", "letter-spacing": "0.3px",
              "background-color": "#0C3549", "color": "#FFFFFF", "border": "none"
            }
          },
          {
            "elmType": "a",
            "txt": "☑   COMPLETE CHECKLIST",
            "attributes": {
              "href": "='FORM_CHECKLIST_UPTO_MACHINE' + [$Machine_ID] + 'FORM_CHECKLIST_UPTO_CELL' + [$Cell_ID] + 'FORM_CHECKLIST_UPTO_CLID' + [$Checklist_ID]",
              "target": "_blank", "role": "button"
            },
            "style": {
              "display": "flex", "align-items": "center", "justify-content": "center",
              "height": "48px", "min-height": "48px", "margin-bottom": "10px",
              "border-radius": "8px", "text-decoration": "none",
              "font-size": "16px", "font-weight": "700",
              "background-color": "#2E86AB", "color": "#FFFFFF", "border": "none"
            }
          },
          {
            "elmType": "a",
            "txt": "🔧   SPARE FITTED",
            "attributes": {
              "href": "='FORM_SPARE_UPTO_MACHINE' + [$Machine_ID] + 'FORM_SPARE_UPTO_CELL' + [$Cell_ID]",
              "target": "_blank", "role": "button"
            },
            "style": {
              "display": "flex", "align-items": "center", "justify-content": "center",
              "height": "48px", "min-height": "48px", "margin-bottom": "10px",
              "border-radius": "8px", "text-decoration": "none",
              "font-size": "16px", "font-weight": "700",
              "background-color": "#5B7B8A", "color": "#FFFFFF", "border": "none"
            }
          },
          {
            "elmType": "a",
            "txt": "⚠   REPORT BREAKDOWN",
            "attributes": {
              "href": "='FORM_BREAKDOWN_UPTO_MACHINE' + [$Machine_ID] + 'FORM_BREAKDOWN_UPTO_CELL' + [$Cell_ID]",
              "target": "_blank", "role": "button"
            },
            "style": {
              "display": "flex", "align-items": "center", "justify-content": "center",
              "height": "48px", "min-height": "48px", "margin-bottom": "10px",
              "border-radius": "8px", "text-decoration": "none",
              "font-size": "16px", "font-weight": "700",
              "background-color": "#ED7373", "color": "#FFFFFF", "border": "none"
            }
          },
          {
            "elmType": "a",
            "txt": "👁   LOG ABNORMALITY",
            "attributes": {
              "href": "='FORM_ABNORMALITY_UPTO_MACHINE' + [$Machine_ID] + 'FORM_ABNORMALITY_UPTO_CELL' + [$Cell_ID]",
              "target": "_blank", "role": "button"
            },
            "style": {
              "display": "flex", "align-items": "center", "justify-content": "center",
              "height": "48px", "min-height": "48px",
              "border-radius": "8px", "text-decoration": "none",
              "font-size": "16px", "font-weight": "700",
              "background-color": "#FFFFFF", "color": "#0C3549", "border": "2px solid #0C3549"
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
}
